 "section_summary": "This section encompasses pages 58 to 108 of a comprehensive 1946 roster of educational institutions in Fukuoka Prefecture, Japan. It continues the listing of municipal elementary schools and kindergartens, followed by town and village secondary schools (including girls' high schools and male, female, and co-educational youth schools) and co-educational elementary schools. The section concludes with private institutions of higher education, specifically universities and specialized colleges, recording comparative student enrollment and teaching staff statistics as of April 30 and November 30, 1946.",
