   "start_page": 58,
   "summary": "This statistical roster details Japanese educational institutions across Fukuoka Prefecture in 1946. Continuing from earlier municipal records, it catalogs municipal elementary schools and nurseries, village and town secondary schools (girls' high schools and youth schools), co-educational elementary schools, and private universities and colleges. Each entry documents the school's official name, location, founding date, and gender-disaggregated counts of students and teachers as of April 30 and November 30, 1946.",
